      "kind": "note",
      "text": "Nominal GB/TB use decimal SI; capacity is a nameplate modeling assumption, not driver-reported free memory."
    },
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "Dense BF16/FP16 matrix peaks are matched to the existing FP32-accumulation compute class; no sparse headline, whole-platform sum or measured efficiency is inferred."
    },
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "FP32 vector peak is a generic ceiling proxy, not measured exp/softmax/SFU throughput. Other precision classes remain absent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "Bidirectional link headlines are not effective collective payload bandwidth. Communication rates and latency remain absent from MI300X."
    }
